                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "At the time of writing this review, the game is in a bare-bones state and not fun at all. It is a very generic RTS with bland graphics and the music of a 90's DOS game. The resolution is a forced-fullscreen 4:3 at a fairly low resolution for that. For 99 cents, I suppose it is everything I paid for. Hopefully updates keep coming and the game gets better. If that happens, I may update this review. If you only have one dollar, I'd recommend even Dead Bits above this game.",
